<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6018] When renaming a model, the description information field is incorrectly modified</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6018</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. The model has description information. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
2. Call the model rename API without uploading the `description` parameter. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
3. The model&apos;s description information is set to empty.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13608991">KYLIN-6018</key>
            <summary>When renaming a model, the description information field is incorrectly modified</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
